# Podman self-contained bundle

Generated by AthanorIDE for `{{ project_name }}` (`{{ project_slug }}`).

This package builds and runs the exported FastAPI app with **rootless Podman**.
No Kubernetes or OKD cluster is required.

## Build

From the repository root (parent of `deploy/`):

```bash
./deploy/podman/build.sh
# or:
podman build -t {{ project_slug }}:latest -f Containerfile .
```

## Run

```bash
podman run --rm -p 8080:8080 {{ project_slug }}:latest
# health: curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8080/health
```

## Compose

```bash
podman compose -f compose.yaml up --build
```

## Push (optional)

```bash
IMAGE_REF=quay.io/example/{{ project_slug }}:latest ./deploy/podman/build.sh --push
```

Secret values are never baked into the image. Pass runtime env with `--env-file` or
`-e` after filling `.env` from `.env.example` locally (do not commit secrets).
